  "abstract": "This is the for-scoring version of the Delta-SOTA with a CNN latent forecaster. The architecture was fully debugged and validated via a unit test in ID 260. This submission removes the test() function to enable a full training run. It will conclusively test the hypothesis that a more powerful temporal model (a 1D CNN) in the latent space can improve upon the MLP-based Delta-SOTA (ID 245) and potentially challenge the new station-wide SOTA.",
